    "body": "Problem:\r\nclang-tidy reports an issue with `atoi()` in insexpand.c\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nclang-tidy 22 renamed cert-err34-c to\r\nbugprone-unchecked-string-to-number-conversion and cert-env33-c to bugprone-command-processor, keeping the old names only as aliases.\r\n\r\n",
